# Install as /etc/hanium/firewall-protected-ipv4.conf, root:root, mode 0644.
# /etc/hanium must be root owned and not writable by other users.
# Add one approved RFC1918 IPv4 per line: router, administration workstation,
# trusted gateways and other hosts which must retain access to the Pi.
# At least one real approved address is required before insert is enabled.
# Actual IPv4 addresses assigned to the Pi are additionally protected at runtime.
# No guessed addresses are supplied by this template.
